", "qa_status": "PASS", "reasoning_effort": "high", "run_id": "run-20261019-categories-remaining-p006-gpt61sol", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8709e6893da9297f0cc8793b8c34dfefba7f39fc26fa04abde8cb3126ac40b90", "stage": "STRUCTURE_OK", "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "left multiplicative", "target_term": "左乘性的"}, {"source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "对"}, {"source_term": "relation", "target_term": "关系"}, {"source_term": "equivalence relation", "target_term": "等价关系"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "合成"}, {"source_term": "equivalence classes", "target_term": "等价类"}, {"source_term": "well defined", "target_term": "良定义的"}, {"source_term": "Composition", "target_term": "合成"}, {"source_term": "associative", "target_term": "结合律"}, {"source_term": "identity morphisms", "target_term": "恒等态射"}, {"source_term": "identity axioms", "target_term": "恒等公理"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是范畴（category），<MATH_0002>是左乘性的（left multiplicative）系统（system）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 上面在对（pairs）上定义的关系（relation）是等价关系（equivalence relation）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 上面给出的合成（composition）规则在等价类（equivalence classes）上是良定义的（well defined）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 合成（Composition）满足结合律（associative）（且恒等态射（identity morphisms）满足恒等公理（identity axioms）），因此<MATH_0003>是一个范畴（category）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:069cff318a60a15010d42581f7e50b75cfe399e8ef3ad0cf986a4922526d4f85", "unit_id": "tag:04VD:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "原范畴及构造的新范畴；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "给定系统的性质；暂定译法。", "source_term": "left multiplicative", "target_term": "左乘性的"}, {"context": "给定左乘性系统；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统"}, {"context": "分式代表对；暂定译法。", "source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "对"}, {"context": "代表对上的关系；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "relation", "target_term": "关系"}, {"context": "关系的自反对称传递性质；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "equivalence relation", "target_term": "等价关系"}, {"context": "分式合成规则；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "composition", "target_term": "合成"}, {"context": "合成所在的类；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "equivalence classes", "target_term": "等价类"}, {"context": "合成不依赖代表选择；暂定译法。", "source_term": "well defined", "target_term": "良定义的"}, {"context": "句首大写形式的合成；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "Composition", "target_term": "合成"}, {"context": "合成的结合性质；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "associative", "target_term": "结合律"}, {"context": "新范畴的恒等箭头；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "identity morphisms", "target_term": "恒等态射"}, {"context": "范畴的恒等公理；暂定译法。", "source_term": "identity axioms", "target_term": "恒等公理"}]}
{"allowed_english": ["LMS"], "context": {"approved_glossary_entries": [], "input_freeze": {"hash": "sha256:38d35232207575a9b64e6d354e5c6f3f8cafce221a1dccb1f179ecb3f3476fcb", "path": "docs/evidence/categories-completion-p006-frozen.json"}, "locked_english_contexts": {"inventory:categories:04VD:lemma/0001": {"context_hash": "sha256:f3aba30d4469934f0451fe112ece025196ff212a2afc294dfbec46416a26f4d0", "inventory_id": "inventory:categories:04VD:lemma/0001", "kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 142854, "byte_start": 142401, "file": "categories.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:b94265af9514c399fc4950ce05c371ad1b50c5b4c243a27351cbbc6c0c082a8f", "line_end": 4012, "line_start": 4001}, "owner_tag": "04VD", "parent_tag": "04VB", "semantic_path": "lemma/0001", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04VB", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-left-localization}", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$S^{-1}\\mathcal{C}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0007": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:6a7d0a9ec26060440f0b4bc961b10187c1ce41af8710c7eaeae155b441e30af2", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b265459f922958093bdfeeceee280c1c4296c68cf0c6e21c99debbf6b767b010", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a category and let <MATH_0002> be a left multiplicative\nsystem.\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> The relation on pairs defined above is an equivalence relation.\n<STRUCT_0004> The composition rule given above is well defined on equivalence\nclasses.\n<STRUCT_0005> Composition is associative (and the identity morphisms satisfy\nthe identity axioms), and hence <MATH_0003> is a category.\n<STRUCT_0006>\n<STRUCT_0007>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0c49e9b2f06b3f2393719b2e3f8dea72363da6342d910016d382f2596dad7902", "unit_id": "inventory:categories:04VD:lemma/0001"}, "state": "READY"}, "inventory:categories:0BM1:remark/0001": {"context_hash": "sha256:15b31f0d6a4dc6da286ffde8f3b779dc8d2543563c973367f62da863b3b2ad95", "inventory_id": "inventory:categories:0BM1:remark/0001", "kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 150614, "byte_start": 149275, "file": "categories.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:9d5dd911044cd2c57b8cb6332f96c76ebdb8a5b78aa7bf2a4915ee39a8628b23", "line_end": 4236, "line_start": 4213}, "owner_tag": "0BM1", "parent_tag": "04VB", "semantic_path": "remark/0001", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "remark", "parent_tag": "04VB", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{remark-motivation-localization}", "MATH_0001": "$S^{-1} \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$S^{-1} \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$S$", "MATH_0006": "$S$", "MATH_0007": "$S^{-1} \\mathcal{C}$", "REF_0001": "\\cite[Section 10A]{Lam}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{remark}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{remark}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:15a1a0fa7cfb30eacb8d3e39ef1406b7c45cca6a1cfd45c5f8b44ddb48c4c27b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bf9d728e69ade54f59ca781dbe913956b12c54912bde43756781fc919a59319e", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nThe motivation for the construction of <MATH_0001> is to\n``force'' the morphisms in <MATH_0002> to be invertible by artificially\ncreating inverses to them (at the cost of some existing morphisms\npossibly becoming identified with each other). This is similar to\nthe localization of a commutative ring at a multiplicative subset,\nand more generally to the localization of a noncommutative ring\nat a right denominator set (see <REF_0001>). This is\nmore than just a similarity: The construction of\n<MATH_0003> (or, more precisely, its version for\nadditive categories <MATH_0004>) actually generalizes the\nlatter type of localization. Namely, a noncommutative ring can be\nviewed as a pre-additive category with a single object (the morphisms\nbeing the elements of the ring); a multiplicative subset of this\nring then becomes a set <MATH_0005> of morphisms satisfying LMS1 (aka\nRMS1). Then, the conditions RMS2 and RMS3 for this category and\nthis subset <MATH_0006> translate into the two conditions\n(``right permutable'' and ``right reversible'') of a right\ndenominator set (and similarly for LMS and left denominator sets),\nand <MATH_0007> (with a properly defined additive\nstructure) is the one-object category corresponding to the\nlocalization of the ring.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8198c38f1043980c5234cf0c50a801363bcd1add377991a726b08fe2d825f873", "unit_id": "inventory:categories:0BM1:remark/0001"}, "state": "READY"}}, "model_output": {"hash": "sha256:015ff956fad84fe5de2f901254633d9f0fa76307794a9d46bd5d2e681ed451bd", "path": "docs/evidence/categories-completion-p006-retry2-raw.jsonl", "record_hash": "sha256:d84a46dcbb36a47880b99b3b43b53de853c4a40bf6c7b4eac2dcb16a0afeadc6"}, "neighbor_unit_ids": ["tag:04VD:statement"], "policy_revision": "git:b33b9b37f1623d49d4030a11f1661dfc29fa2ce4", "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "read_context": {"citations": [], "neighbors": [{"context_id": "inventory:categories:04VD:lemma/0001", "relation": "before"}, {"context_id": "inventory:categories:0BM1:remark/0001", "relation": "after"}], "references": [], "unit_id": "tag:04VD:proof"}, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_required_terms": {"catalog_hash": "sha256:899a668e